&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;100.14 – Surgery for Diabetes (RETIRED)&lt;br&gt;
(Rev. 11892; Issued: 03-09-23; Effective: 04-10-23; Implementation: 04-10-23)&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note section 100.14 has been removed from the NCD Manual and incorporated into NCD 100.1 effective September 24, 2013.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

